# Keeps the build context small and, more importantly, keeps secrets out of it.
# A .env copied into a layer stays in the image history even if a later layer
# deletes it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage

.git
.github
docs
standalone
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
*.md
!README.md
